  ('b8860825-61a3-5462-ab7b-8eebaedb52af', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g11-argument-evidence'), null, 'hard',
   $q$Which statement best evaluates the evidence in the paragraph about wildlife?$q$, $q$[{"text":"The moth studies are useless because they were done in other countries.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overstates-flaw"},{"text":"The moth studies support the insect claim, but the bird claim has no support.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Both the insect and bird claims are supported by the same moth studies.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-evidence"},{"text":"The paragraph is strong because it names a specific institute's review.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-paragraphs"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$The moth studies support the insect claim, but the bird claim has no support.$q$, $q$Studies "in several countries" back the point about insects, but the statement about migrating birds is made without any study or data. The institute review appears later, in the paragraph about drivers.$q$, 'draft', 'd0776ff5-fcbd-5fcb-8d82-c853d605cca8')
