   $q$What is the author's central claim?$q$, $q$[{"text":"The Lindqvist Museum should reopen its east galleries.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"Every museum in the state should stop charging admission.","is_correct":true},{"text":"The Lindqvist should host more traveling exhibitions.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-counterclaims"},{"text":"Museums should rely on gift shops instead of donations.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Every museum in the state should stop charging admission.$q$, $q$The first paragraph ends, "every museum in the state should drop its admission fees," and the conclusion repeats it. The gift shop is one of several revenue sources, not the claim.$q$, 'draft', '641390e0-ee28-5d5a-a030-4a90a6d0fe11')
