   $q$What is the purpose of the paragraph that begins "None of this means chess is worthless"?$q$, $q$[{"text":"To admit that the district's plan is correct after all.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"To introduce new evidence that chess raises math scores.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-evidence"},{"text":"To argue that the district should close its chess clubs.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"To limit the writer's objection to required lessons justified by math gains.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$To limit the writer's objection to required lessons justified by math gains.$q$, $q$By granting that chess has value and suggesting clubs or electives, the writer makes clear the target is the required lesson defended on math grounds. The paragraph says the clubs could reasonably stay, not close.$q$, 'draft', '770035f2-3fb5-5569-bc1c-d7534f7225a2')
